              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-3xl font-black text-[#38BDF8]">Plus or minus 4%</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1">Common clockwise rating for click wrenches</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-3xl font-black text-white">5,000 cycles</p>
